sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Cluster Admin / SRE
    participant CLI as rhai-cli
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant OLM as OLM<br/>(via Kubernetes API)
    participant TrustYAI as TrustYAI Service<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2
    participant GitHub as raw.githubusercontent.com<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Agent as AI Agent<br/>(Claude/GPT/Cursor)
    participant MCP as MCP Server<br/>(stdio or 8080/TCP SSE)

    Note over User,K8sAPI: Flow 1: Upgrade Readiness Lint
    User->>CLI: rhai-cli lint --target-version X.Y
    CLI->>CLI: RBAC pre-flight check<br/>(SelfSubjectAccessReview)
    CLI->>K8sAPI: List DSC, DSCI, CRDs, Deployments<br/>Auth: kubeconfig credentials
    K8sAPI-->>CLI: Resource data
    CLI->>CLI: Run 4-tier lint checks<br/>(components, deps, platform, workloads)
    CLI-->>User: Lint results<br/>(severity-gated: prohibited/critical/warning/info)

    Note over Agent,K8sAPI: Flow 2: MCP Agent Interaction
    Agent->>MCP: JSON-RPC tool call<br/>(stdio or SSE/8080)
    MCP->>MCP: Map to cmd.Command interface
    MCP->>K8sAPI: Execute cluster operation<br/>Auth: kubeconfig credentials
    K8sAPI-->>MCP: Response
    MCP-->>Agent: JSON-RPC result<br/>(structured JSON schema output)

    Note over CLI,TrustYAI: Flow 3: TrustYAI Metric Migration
    User->>CLI: rhai-cli migrate --action trustyai-metrics
    CLI->>CLI: Dry-run preview (if --dry-run)
    CLI->>K8sAPI: Discover TrustYAI routes<br/>Auth: kubeconfig credentials
    K8sAPI-->>CLI: Route URLs
    CLI->>TrustYAI: GET /metrics (backup)<br/>Auth: Bearer token<br/>TLS: InsecureSkipVerify=true
    TrustYAI-->>CLI: Metric data
    CLI->>TrustYAI: POST /metrics (restore)<br/>Auth: Bearer token
    TrustYAI-->>CLI: Confirmation
    CLI-->>User: Migration complete

    Note over CLI,GitHub: Flow 4: Dependency Management
    User->>CLI: rhai-cli deps --refresh
    CLI->>GitHub: GET values.yaml, Chart.yaml<br/>from odh-gitops pinned commit
    GitHub-->>CLI: Dependency manifests
    CLI->>K8sAPI: Check OLM Subscriptions, CSVs<br/>Auth: kubeconfig credentials
    K8sAPI-->>CLI: Operator status
    CLI-->>User: Dependency report
